<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Mining 6-month net down 79 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Mining 6-month net down 79 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to July 31</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     0.1     vs	0.8</p>
<p>    Net profit		 1.02    vs	4.86</p>
<p>    Turnover		 681.19    vs    577.35</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  24.80    vs     36.20</p>
<p>    Minorities	less   4.79    vs less 3.94</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)     1.5     vs	1.7</p>
<p>Note - Malaysia Mining Corp Bhd is involved in mining operations, mineral exploration and property investment among other businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
